historical sites or monuments using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Name"},{"text":"Location"},{"text":"Period"},{"text":"Dynasty"},{"text":"Monument type"},{"text":"Available inscriptions"},{"text":"Language/script"},{"text":"Sources"},{"text":"Photographs"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Epigraphy & Palaeography","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Now move into the specialist domain."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"History of Indian scripts"},{"text":"Palaeography"},{"text":"Epigraphic methods"},{"text":"Inscription documentation"},{"text":"Dating techniques"},{"text":"Historical linguistics"},{"text":"Transliteration"},{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Archaeological documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important distinction"},{"type":"p","text":"Epigraphy = study of inscriptions."},{"type":"p","text":"Palaeography = study of historical writing systems and scripts."},{"type":"p","text":"The two are closely connected."},{"type":"h","text":"Practical work"},{"type":"p","text":"Take publicly documented inscriptions and practise:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Image","Script identification","Transcription","Transliteration","Translation","Historical interpretation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Always clearly distinguish between your own interpretation and established scholarly readings."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Fieldwork + Digital Heritage","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop professional documentation skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Fieldwork skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Monument documentation"},{"text":"Photography"},{"text":"Measurement"},{"text":"Site recording"},{"text":"Condition documentation"},{"text":"GPS/GIS"},{"text":"Field notes"},{"text":"Archival research"},{"text":"Heritage ethics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"Digital photography"},{"text":"OCR concepts"},{"text":"Image enhancement"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Digital repositories"},{"text":"Basic Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital humanities"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital inscription databases"},{"text":"Historical maps"},{"text":"Searchable text collections"},{"text":"Metadata systems"},{"text":"Digital heritage catalogues"}]}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Skills","Portfolio"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Ancient history"},{"text":"History, archaeology, language"},{"text":"Heritage catalogue"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Epigraphy"},{"text":"Scripts, palaeography, transcription"},{"text":"Inscription documentation"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Field + digital"},{"text":"GIS, photography, databases"},{"text":"Digital epigraphy project"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professional/research"},{"text":"Fieldwork + research"},{"text":"Epigraphy portfolio"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For a three-year BA, integrate Year 4 activities into the final year."}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"History"},{"text":"Ancient Indian history"}],[{"text":"Archaeology"},{"text":"Site/artefact documentation"}],[{"text":"Epigraphy"},{"text":"Inscription study"}],[{"text":"Palaeography"},{"text":"Historical scripts"}],[{"text":"Languages"},{"text":"Sanskrit/regional/classical languages"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Archival and textual research"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Transcription, metadata"}],[{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"QGIS, mapping"}],[{"text":"Photography"},{"text":"Heritage documentation"}],[{"text":"Digital Humanities"},{"text":"OCR, databases, digitisation"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Excel, SQL"}],[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"OCR, script recognition, text analysis"}],[{"text":"Academic"},{"text":"Citation, publishing, research writing"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships & Field Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Practical heritage experience is extremely valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"Target organisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archaeological research institutions"},{"text":"Museums"},{"text":"Archives"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Heritage organisations"},{"text":"Archaeological departments"},{"text":"Manuscript libraries"},{"text":"Cultural institutions"},{"text":"Historical research centres"},{"text":"Digital humanities projects"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful internship roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archaeology Intern"},{"text":"Heritage Documentation Intern"},{"text":"Epigraphy Research Intern"},{"text":"Museum Intern"},{"text":"Archive Intern"},{"text":"Digital Humanities Intern"},{"text":"Research Assistant"},{"text":"Heritage Digitisation Intern"},{"text":"Field Documentation Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal progression"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Museum/heritage exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Research/archaeology internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"p","text":"Epigraphy/fieldwork/digital humanities project"},{"type":"h","text":"Final year"},{"type":"p","text":"Specialised research internship"}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Inscription Catalogue"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a catalogue of 50–100 publicly documented inscriptions."},{"type":"p","text":"Fields could include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inscription ID"},{"text":"Location"},{"text":"Monument"},{"text":"Approximate period"},{"text":"Dynasty"},{"text":"Language"},{"text":"Script"},{"text":"Material"},{"text":"Inscription type"},{"text":"Source"},{"text":"Bibliographic reference"},{"text":"Image reference"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Regional Epigraphy Map"},{"type":"p","text":"Use QGIS to map inscriptions across a region."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Medieval inscriptions of Andhra Pradesh/Telangana\""},{"type":"p","text":"Map:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Location"},{"text":"Date/period"},{"text":"Dynasty"},{"text":"Language"},{"text":"Script"},{"text":"Monument type"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["This combines history","archaeology","GIS."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Script Evolution Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Study how a historical script evolved over time."},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Timeline"},{"text":"Character examples"},{"text":"Script comparison"},{"text":"Geographic distribution"},{"text":"Scholarly references"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Digital Inscription Archive"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a searchable digital archive containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Images"},{"text":"Transcriptions"},{"text":"Transliteration"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"References"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This can become a strong portfolio project."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Epigraphic Research Paper"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one inscription and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Historical context"},{"text":"Patron"},{"text":"Date"},{"text":"Language"},{"text":"Script"},{"text":"Administrative information"},{"text":"Religious context"},{"text":"Social information"},{"text":"Existing scholarly interpretations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use established academic sources and clearly cite them."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Formal certificates are less important than language, script and research competence."},{"type":"h","text":"Useful learning areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sanskrit"},{"text":"Palaeography"},{"text":"Epigraphy"},{"text":"Archaeology"},{"text":"Museology"},{"text":"Heritage Conservation"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Digital Humanities"},{"text":"Archival Stu