,{"text":"Canada"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For an Indian epigraphy specialisation, international study can be particularly valuable when the programme has expertise in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"South Asian studies"},{"text":"Sanskrit"},{"text":"Historical linguistics"},{"text":"Archaeology"},{"text":"Digital humanities"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A realistic pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Heritage/Archaeology Intern","Research/Documentation Assistant","Epigraphy Assistant / Archaeology Assistant","Research Associate / Specialist","Epigraphist / Archaeologist / Heritage Researcher","Senior Researcher / Project Lead","Senior Epigraphist / Heritage Specialist / Academic"]},{"type":"h","text":"Academic pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Assistant","PhD Researcher","Postdoctoral/Research Fellow","Faculty/Research Scientist"]}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Opportunities","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A. Sanskrit Epigraphy"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sanskrit"},{"text":"Brahmi-derived scripts"},{"text":"Temple inscriptions"},{"text":"Royal inscriptions"},{"text":"Religious inscriptions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"B. South Indian Epigraphy"},{"type":"p","text":"Specialise in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tamil"},{"text":"Telugu"},{"text":"Kannada"},{"text":"Malayalam"},{"text":"Regional scripts"},{"text":"Chola"},{"text":"Pallava"},{"text":"Chalukya"},{"text":"Vijayanagara"},{"text":"Kakatiya and other regional traditions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This can be particularly valuable for someone interested in the history of South India."},{"type":"h","text":"C. Digital Epigraphy"},{"type":"p","text":"A highly future-oriented specialisation."},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Epigraphy","OCR","AI","GIS","Databases"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital inscription databases"},{"text":"Script recognition"},{"text":"Image enhancement"},{"text":"Historical-text digitisation"},{"text":"Searchable inscription repositories"}]},{"type":"h","text":"D. Heritage Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Monuments"},{"text":"Archaeological sites"},{"text":"Inscriptions"},{"text":"Digital photography"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"3D documentation"},{"text":"Conservation records"}]},{"type":"h","text":"E. Museum & Collection Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Epigraphy","Museology","Collection Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Work can involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Artefact documentation"},{"text":"Catalogue preparation"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Exhibitions"},{"text":"Digital collections"}]}]},{"heading":"AI & Future of Epigraphy — 2030–2045","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI is likely to become a powerful research assistant in epigraphy."},{"type":"h","text":"Possible applications"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Historical-script recognition"},{"text":"Character classification"},{"text":"Image enhancement"},{"text":"Text reconstruction"},{"text":"Transliteration assistance"},{"text":"Translation assistance"},{"text":"Named-entity extraction"},{"text":"Database creation"},{"text":"Similar-inscription discovery"},{"text":"Geographic pattern analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A future workflow could look like:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Inscription Photograph","Image Enhancement","AI-assisted Script Recognition","OCR / Character Extraction","Human Epigraphist Verification","Transliteration","Translation","Historical Interpretation","Digital Repository"]},{"type":"p","text":"AI will be particularly useful for large-scale comparison, but scholarly verification remains essential because damaged inscriptions, unusual scripts and historical language can produce significant errors."}]},{"heading":"Future-Proof Skill Combination","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest modern profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Epigraphy","Ancient History","Classical/Regional Language","Palaeography","GIS","Digital Humanities","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A particularly powerful combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Epigraphy","Sanskrit/Regional Language","Palaeography","GIS","OCR","Digital Archives"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This transforms a traditional humanities specialisation into a digital heritage research career."}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ancient Indian history"},{"text":"Archaeology"},{"text":"Cultural history"},{"text":"Religious history"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Language"},{"type":"p","text":"At least one strong specialist language, such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sanskrit"},{"text":"Tamil"},{"text":"Telugu"},{"text":"Kannada"},{"text":"Pali/Prakrit"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Epigraphy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Script identification"},{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Transliteration"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Inscription documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Fieldwork"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heritage photography"},{"text":"Site documentation"},{"text":"GPS/GIS"},{"text":"Field notes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Digital repositories"},{"text":"Basic Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Ideally:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"50–100 inscription catalogue"},{"text":"Regional epigraphy map"},{"text":"Script-evolution project"},{"text":"Digital inscription archive"},{"text":"1–2 research papers"},{"text":"Heritage/archaeology internship"},{"text":"Field documentation project"}]}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Paths","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A graduate can also pursue:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Epigraphy Assistant"},{"text":"Epigraphist"},{"text":"Archaeology Assistant"},{"text":"Archaeologist"},{"text":"Heritage Researcher"},{"text":"Historical Researcher"},{"text":"Palaeographer"},{"text":"Museum Research Assistant"},{"text":"Museum Curator"},{"text":"Digital Archivist"},{"text":"Digital Humanities Researcher"},{"text":"Heritage Documentation Specialist"},{"text":"Manuscript Specialist"},{"text":"Sanskrit Researcher"},{"text":"Archaeological Documentation Officer"},{"text":"Cultural Heritage Manager"},{"text":"Research Associate"},{"text":"Academic/University Researcher"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Practical Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Ancient Indian History, Culture & Archaeology","Year 1: Ancient history + archaeology + Sanskrit/regional language","Year 2: Epigraphy + palaeography + transcription + translation","Year 3: Field documentation + QGIS + digital archives + OCR","Heritage/archaeology research internship","Build inscription catalogue + GIS map + digital epigraphy project","MA Archaeology / Ancient History / Sanskrit / related specialisation","Epigraphy Research Assistant / Archaeology Assistant","Epigraphy Specialist / Epigraphist / Archaeologist","Senior Researcher / Heritage Specialist / Academic"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best long-term combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["Ancient Indian History","Epigraphy","Palaeography","Sanskrit/Regional Language","Archaeology","GIS","Digital Humanities","AI/OCR"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the most valuable differentiator is specialist knowledge. A graduate who combines ancient history with a strong classical/regional language, script expertise and modern digital tools can build a niche profile in epigraphy, archaeology, museums, archives and digital heritage research."}]}]}